            <ArticleTitle>Malrotation causing duodenal chronic obstruction in an adult.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1144-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Congenital duodenal obstruction is rare in adulthood. An unusual presentation of this condition has led to difficult preoperative diagnosis. We present a case of proximal jejunal obstruction by a congenital band in an adult and review the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
